WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:10.858
Berry wiped away some tears.

2
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:17.832
"You ruined my airplane, Cupcake!"

3
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:25.919
He left the sink.

4
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.893
Bok Choy shook his head.

5
00:00:30.894 --> 00:00:39.281
Then he left.

6
00:00:39.282 --> 00:00:43.939
Cupcake felt awful.

7
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:50.130
Suddenly the wet airplane flopped open.

8
00:00:50.131 --> 00:00:54.100
Cupcake looked at it closely.

9
00:00:54.101 --> 00:00:59.569
She unfolded it some more.

10
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:06.504
Then she folded it back.

11
00:01:06.505 --> 00:01:11.058
"Hmm," Cupcake said.

12
00:01:11.059 --> 00:01:14.780
"I can learn to fold paper.

13
00:01:14.781 --> 00:01:21.332
Maybe it's not hard after all."

14
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:25.703
She got a sheet of paper. This

15
00:01:25.704 --> 00:01:32.467
time she worked very slowly. Berry

16
00:01:32.468 --> 00:01:37.398
was sitting by his tent. He

17
00:01:37.399 --> 00:01:41.493
was still mad. Bonk!

18
00:01:41.494 --> 00:01:46.585
A paper airplane hit him! He

19
00:01:46.586 --> 00:01:55.373
saw words on it: Open me .

20
00:01:55.374 --> 00:02:00.488
Berry opened the airplane.

21
00:02:00.489 --> 00:02:04.105
Dear Berry,

22
00:02:04.106 --> 00:02:08.395
I'm sorry I ruined your airplane.

23
00:02:08.396 --> 00:02:11.361
You can have this one.

24
00:02:11.362 --> 00:02:21.352
Love, Cupcake

25
00:02:21.353 --> 00:02:26.850
Berry looked down.

26
00:02:26.851 --> 00:02:30.629
He saw Cupcake.

27
00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:36.979
Her eyes were wide. "Are we still friends?"

28
00:02:36.980 --> 00:03:02.601
Berry smiled. "Best friends!"

